Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,if there's any chance at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.43,0:03:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I realize that I was the one who suggested it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but canceling out all those D-Mails...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it'll be pretty tough,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.39,0:04:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.60,0:04:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Your brain's a valuable specimen, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.70,0:04:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're able to keep your memories across worldline shifts,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.24,0:04:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and you've survived time leaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.66,0:04:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We should map it—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.49,0:04:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't remember that you called me Kurisu, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.82,0:05:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Going in order, the next one you should undo is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Faris's D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.13,0:05:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,do you know where Faris is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.59,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.59,0:05:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where? Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The UPX Arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The final round of the Rai-Net ABGC just ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ABGC?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Short for the Rai-Net Access Battlers Grand Championship, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.19,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tournament among Rai-Netters from across Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It just ended with her victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After Faris sent her D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Akiba returned to only selling electronics.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.12,0:05:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no idea what was in her message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who did she send it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.71,0:05:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What did she send?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.09,0:06:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.51,0:06:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The catgirl's with some guy in a lab coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let her escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.93,0:06:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that she could...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.81,0:06:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can escape my Force of Darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.44,0:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's chasing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The Viral Attackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The Viral Attackers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the worst kind of Rai-Netter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.58,0:06:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll do anything to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They were mad about losing to Faris,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.21,0:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,so they set an ambush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,An ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gotta be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, didn't you just call me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to tell me about your D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.67,0:07:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.34,0:07:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The message you sent to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A message I sent to the past?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.80,0:07:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In this worldline,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.64,0:07:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Faris doesn't remember sending a D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypothetically speaking... Hypothetically,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.37,0:07:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,if I said we built a time machine, would you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd believe anything you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.00,0:07:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris just built a dimensional transport machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.58,0:08:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's imagine that Akiba was a city engrossed in the culture of moe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.43,0:08:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Say you used the time machine to change it to the electronics market it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.02,0:08:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of game is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.23,0:08:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever! Please just answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.27,0:08:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't really know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.98,0:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I bet a city immersed in the culture of moe would be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.24,0:08:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I talked to Dad about it once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,About opening a maid café in Akiba, that is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but he said I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean MayQueen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I never even told my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.09,0:08:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It used to exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.72,0:08:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here in Akiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Akiba was full of moe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.18,0:08:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.14,0:08:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You loved that city more than anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:09:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But once you sent that message,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.48,0:09:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the whole city changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you send?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.65,0:09:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There they are! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where MayQueen used to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the café you wanted to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.01,0:09:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.23,0:09:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru came all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.23,0:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We met here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.95,0:09:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.54,0:10:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get it right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.46,0:10:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We now begin the Faris Cup day division.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Code Name: G-BACK {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's my "the World's In Danger"!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A lot of customers came in today. It was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.98,0:10:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens if you can't undo the D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.73,0:10:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri's life is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.65,0:10:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.20,0:10:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean her "life is in danger"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.91,0:10:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to undo it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.42,0:10:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri... You don't care if Mayuri dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.18,0:10:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.89,0:11:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I brought my dad back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.47,0:11:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,after his death ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.31,0:11:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I changed the past...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to prevent his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.39,0:11:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your pretty face is ruined, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.39,0:11:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Princess, you're coming with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We caught the catgirl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}My super dangerous aura's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.03,0:11:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be seeing him soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.36,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}been telling me it wants this catgirl stained black.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.32,0:11:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, we'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Only one can stand at a scene's forefront,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.04,0:12:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}the phoenix with black wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.79,0:12:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.92,0:12:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You there, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.25,0:12:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll make the catgirl mine with an elegant, crazy dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Still want to play?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.34,0:12:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.31,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.18,0:12:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}And that'll be the last thing she ever sees...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.27,0:12:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you kids doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.32,0:12:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.86,0:12:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The police? I'm under arrest?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.54,0:12:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.75,0:12:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.01,0:13:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to celebrate,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't see you at the UPX arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't answer your phone, so I went looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.18,0:13:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, I don't know how to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.31,0:13:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I'd gone to see the tournament,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.15,0:13:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,this wouldn't have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.40,0:13:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You have work. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.07,0:13:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Rumiho...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.16,0:13:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,An IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.12,0:13:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I know you don't have it anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but where is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you get it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.96,0:13:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for Hashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.51,0:13:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,She was the one who gave me the IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.93,0:13:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.44,0:13:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll find the IBN 5100, and I'll get it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:13:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.03,0:14:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She got it for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.03,0:14:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, you can tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.33,0:14:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He saved my life, and he really wants to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.21,0:14:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A long time ago, Rumiho was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The company wasn't as big as it is now,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so I couldn't pay the ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.22,0:14:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, someone came and told me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,that she'd purchase the IBN 5100 for a huge amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how you lost it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.69,0:14:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that, I was able to pay the ransom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.11,0:14:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always kept my promises to my daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.66,0:14:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how small,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.49,0:14:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:54.54,Crayon,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\be2\pos(1533,169.5)\frz345.187\frx14\fry348}Rumiho
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.99,0:14:54.54,Crayon,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1000)\pos(1134,183)\be2\frx14\fry344\frz22.882}Papa
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I brought my dad back to life
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.92,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}after his death ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.17,0:15:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I changed the past to prevent his death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.22,0:15:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If I send the D-Mail, he'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.93,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okarin, are you sending a D-Mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If you do that, all of this will disappear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.73,0:15:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I don't, Mayuri, you'll—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.28,0:15:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.16,0:15:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.75,0:15:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.13,0:15:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Thanks for earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.88,0:15:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt that much darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.10,0:15:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,from so many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they all wearing black?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.06,0:15:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm being serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.15,0:16:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.32,0:16:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me Rumiho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.36,0:16:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you, Kyouma— I mean, Okabe,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what would've happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.54,0:16:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't correct yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just call me what you always do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Kyouma, thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You're... my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.68,0:16:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.93,0:16:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a mad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Mayushii's life is in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years ago, on my eighth birthday,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,my dad promised to take me somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:17:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but work came up, so he had to cancel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it wasn't his fault, but I was so lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought he didn't love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I told him I hated him, that I wanted him to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.01,0:17:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.81,0:17:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,that was the last time I ever spoke to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:17.10,Telly,,0,0,0,,{\be6\frz337.919\t(\fscx120\fscy120)\move(268.5,573,313.5,690)}Died in the crash...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.56,0:17:19.60,Telly,,0,0,0,,{\fs102\bord0\be15\pos(1002,489)\frz19.8}Japanese passenger, Akiha Yukitaka...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent a D-Mail to change that past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:22.15,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\be3\fs60\pos(1278,681)}We have your daughter.\NTake the Shinkansen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.15,0:17:22.77,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\be6\fs112.5\pos(372,666)}Ransom is 100 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:22.81,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\be6\fs112.5\pos(372,666)}Ransom is 100 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:22.85,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\be6\fs112.5\pos(372,666)}Ransom is 100 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.85,0:17:22.90,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\be6\fs112.5\pos(372,666)}Ransom is 100 million yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:23.48,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fs82.5\be6\pos(108,639)}We have your daughter. Ransom is 100 million yen. \NTake the Shinkansen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.27,0:17:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,2043)}So he wasn't in the crash,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.69,0:17:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and you never brought the culture of moe to Akiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.36,0:17:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and it remained an electronics market.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.45,0:17:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.62,0:17:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,these ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Fa— Rumiho...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.38,0:17:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll send that D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.13,0:17:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad died in an accident ten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what really happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.05,0:17:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,These ten years have been a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.43,0:17:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.01,0:17:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how much he loved me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.35,0:18:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mayushii's my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.35,0:18:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.98,0:18:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,what happened before the worldline changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but I remember what happened after too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all mixed together,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and I don't think I'll be able to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,which is real for much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.97,0:18:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! I can ask Kurisu—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.35,0:18:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I don't want to cause you any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.52,0:18:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for me to wake up from this dream,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but let me have one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I cry a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.86,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she accepted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.69,0:19:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.11,0:19:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.95,0:19:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kyouma?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You look down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:48.92,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be6\an4\frz331.003\clip(0,219,1920,1080)\move(-142.5,1152,105,357)}The kidnapping was just a joke. \NI love you, Daddy. See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.88,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.63,0:19:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,if the world reverts to how it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.51,0:19:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,will all my memories vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.97,0:20:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your memories are from before and after
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the worldline changed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.35,0:20:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.06,0:20:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris wouldn't want to forget her time with Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.20,0:20:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's ready, Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.12,0:20:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Daddy.{good-bye is a contraction of "God be with ye." fun fact of the day}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.85,0:20:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen my cell phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii says she doesn't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.35,0:20:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so you're the only person I can ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma, did you see what was on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.61,0:21:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If you did, forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.24,0:21:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It must remain forever sealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma, why don't you say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, "What was on it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.08,0:21:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.38,0:21:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off her!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.38,0:21:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing something perverted again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.47,0:21:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin's so bold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma and Faris fought a great darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,as lovers in a past life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really close!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You fight lots of people, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are Faris and Okabe that alike?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The IBN 5100 wasn't at Yanabayashi Shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ten years ago, Faris gave it to the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.01,0:22:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They said it was there until last year.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.10,0:22:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...did it go?
